      "title": "Happy Labor Day!",
      "date": "2025-04-30 09:33:41",
      "url": "https://steamstore-a.akamaihd.net/news/externalpost/steam_community_announcements/1798454487571620",
      "content": "[img]{STEAM_CLAN_IMAGE}/44450918/aa694aa5f7334344c363ee13907f4a5151705eb8.jpg[/img]\n[h3]The holiday for the working people is just around the corner! On this occasion, we sincerely wish all friends who strive for life and fight for their passions the best![/h3]\n\nTo celebrate the Golden Week, LSP brings you a series of events, ta-da\uff5e\n\uff3c\uff3c\\ \ua415 \ua415 \ua415 //\uff0f\uff0f\n\n[h3]\ud83d\udce6 Themed Bundle[/h3]\n[img]{STEAM_CLAN_IMAGE}/44450918/dd2343abe9e0d11c3e9a5039dbcbbc44fa766ae1.jpg[/img]\n\nEven if you're in the employment buffer pool, you're contributing to the nation\u2014so you deserve a glorious Labor Day!\n\"Happy Labor Day! Limited-Time Bundle\" will be available during the May Day holiday\u2014\n\nhttps://store.steampowered.com/bundle/52874/\n\nFrom April 30 for two weeks, get all games in the bundle with a 15% discount.\n\n[h3]\ud83c\udfaa Festival Sale[/h3]\n[img]{STEAM_CLAN_IMAGE}/44450918/1b9e5f6a2a2210004e457ed62c83e34a709ac8db.png[/img]\nDuring the Golden Week, LSP offers special prices on our published games. Enjoy historic low discounts until May 14.\n\n[b]>>>>> [url=https://store.steampowered.com/developer/LSPGAL/list/147049 style=button]Go to Sale Page[/url][/b]\n\n[hr][/hr]\n[url=https://store.steampowered.com/publisher/LSPGAL][img]{STEAM_CLAN_IMAGE}/44450918/f401f52f0a9229a52edcab41ea441474c1856f8c.png[/img][/url]\nFollow our [url=https://store.steampowered.com/publisher/LSPGAL]publisher page[/url] for the latest news~"
    },
